    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061130.0055\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 30 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nGrenada parliamentary leaders to visit China\n\n\n\n\nGrenada President of the Senate Kenny Lalsingh and Speaker of the House of Representatives Lawrence Joseph will pay an official goodwill visit to China from Dec. 3 to 9.\n\nThe Grenada parliamentary leaders will pay the visit at the invitation of Wu Bangguo, chairman of the Standing Committee of the National People's Congress, according to sources with this top legislature of China Thursday.",
